        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4861, 12 Inch Lined Appliance Pull with Petals at Ends</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Refrigerator Pull With Petal Ends will look very chic in classically styled kitchens. It is easy to install as it comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware for most appliances. Adding your own handles to existing appliances is a great way to bring a cohesive look to your kitchen, plus the 12 Inch Lined Appliance Pull with Petals at Ends will add elegance to your space. Choose from 6 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis appliance pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-ridged-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-859\"><b>Rustic Ridged Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AP-PH-4861 Traditional Appliance Pull With Petal Ends:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
